Package: libgtksourceview-5-0
Version: @DEB_GTKSOURCEVIEW5_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wiki.gnome.org/Projects/GtkSourceView
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libpango-1.0-0, libxml2, libpcre2-8-0, libfribidi0
Description: Source-code editing widget for GTK4 - runtime
 GtkSourceView extends the GTK4 text widget with syntax highlighting and other
 features for editing source code. This package contains the shared library and
 the language-specification and style data.
